@Hallo In art there is this wonderful saying "the customer doesn't know what they want".

It's simply that most customers will show up and say "I want something yellow", which isn't really a description beyond "here is a bucket of paint".

It's the same thing we are all doing, we show up to our AI agents saying "we want PnL", AI responds "here is a generic algorithm"

@logic_gate that's beautiful thinking, but you have jumped past a big bit of logic here.


Say the current price is 100, you do by chance know that the current trend is negative and will continue for another 10 timesteps.

Do you feel like selling a few extra pieces now and buying them back in 10 timesteps?
